      hu: "Jelentős japán tengeri kikötő Hjógo prefektúrában. Az 1995-ös nagy Hansin földrengés előtt a világ egyik legforgalmasabbja volt.",
      ro: "Un important port maritim japonez în prefectura Hyōgo. A fost unul dintre cele mai aglomerate din lume înainte de Marele Cutremur Hanshin din 1995.",
      en: "A major Japanese seaport in Hyōgo Prefecture. It was one of the world's busiest before the 1995 Great Hanshin earthquake.",
